# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Omar Abou El Kheir et al. (2024). Unraveling the crystallization kinetics of the Ge2Sb2Te5 phase change compound with a machine-learned interatomic potential.
#   npj Computational Materials. doi:10.1038/s41524-024-01217-6  arXiv:2304.03109v2
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2304.03109v2 (sha256 64022610aab0b4cd...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 373 (Application/model instance). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/kheir2024.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the CP2K PBE database of GST225 (liquid, supercooled
# liquid, quenching, amorphous, cubic, hexagonal and metadynamics
# configurations; Table I, about 180,000 configurations), the DeePMD
# potential (two-body se_e2 cutoff 7 A plus three-body 3.8 A embeddings,
# fitting net 120-60-30-15, 200 epochs) and its training and test RMSEs.
# Structural, dynamical and crystallization properties are properties.

